Domain Entity Program
    documentation 'This entity represents any program designed to work in conjunction with, or as a 
                  'supplement to, the main academic program. Programs may provide instruction, 
                  'training, services, or benefits through federal, state, or local agencies. 
                  'Programs may also include organized extracurricular activities for students.
    reference EducationOrganization
        documentation 'Relates the program to an EducationOrganization.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    string ProgramId
        documentation 'A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to a program by a school, school 
                      'system, a state, or other agency or entity.
        is optional
        is queryable field
        min length 1
        max length 20
    string ProgramName
        documentation 'The formal name of the Program of instruction, training, services, or benefits 
                      'available through federal, state, or local agencies.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
        min length 1
        max length 60
    enumeration ProgramType
        documentation 'The type of program.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    descriptor ProgramCharacteristic
        documentation 'Reflects important characteristics of the Program, such as categories or 
                      'particular indications.
        is optional collection
    enumeration ProgramSponsor
        documentation 'Ultimate and intermediate providers of funds for a particular educational 
                      'or service program or activity, or for an individual's participation in the program 
                      'or activity (e.g., Federal, State, ESC, District, School, Private Organization).
        is optional
    descriptor Service
        documentation 'Defines the services this program provides to students.
        is optional collection
    reference LearningObjective
        documentation 'References the LearningObjective(s) with which the Program is associated.
        is optional collection
    reference LearningStandard
        documentation 'LearningStandard followed by this program.
        is optional collection
